    {
      "id": "31197390",
      "title": "Adding an Android Ripple Effect & an iOS Alternative",
      "lectureOrder": 32,
      "videoOrder": 29,
      "sourceHash": "5bb193ed1041a2eafecd57072af99c6eff9befb39cad21ba93958aa7fb6bb0d7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.02,
          "end": 4.36,
          "en": "So let's now work on the styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.36,
          "end": 7.9,
          "en": "of this pressable component or of this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.9,
          "end": 10.11,
          "en": "if the item is currently pressed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.11,
          "end": 12.943,
          "en": "because at the moment we got no visual feedback.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.2,
          "end": 16.26,
          "en": "Now, adding some nice styling here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.26,
          "end": 18.78,
          "en": "is fairly easy for Android",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.82,
          "end": 23.41,
          "en": "because there is a dedicated android_ripple prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.41,
          "end": 25.72,
          "en": "which you you can set to an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.72,
          "end": 28.94,
          "en": "where you can set the color of the ripple effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.94,
          "end": 30.6,
          "en": "And for example here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.6,
          "end": 34.34,
          "en": "I could set this color to some dark gray",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.34,
          "end": 38.31,
          "en": "by adding six Ds here, this hex code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.31,
          "end": 41.3,
          "en": "And if I do that, if I set this value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.3,
          "end": 45.793,
          "en": "for the android_ripple prop here on Android,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.06,
          "end": 48.71,
          "en": "if I add a goal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.18,
          "end": 51.77,
          "en": "and I press this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.77,
          "end": 54.12,
          "en": "there is a slight ripple effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.12,
          "end": 55.45,
          "en": "Let me show this again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.45,
          "end": 56.753,
          "en": "Here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.43,
          "end": 60.69,
          "en": "if I then press this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.69,
          "end": 61.523,
          "en": "You see?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.523,
          "end": 64.403,
          "en": "There is this ripple effect around this item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.16,
          "end": 67.76,
          "en": "Now, if you wanna have the ripple effect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.76,
          "end": 70.21000000000001,
          "en": "inside of that item instead,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.21000000000001,
          "end": 74.52,
          "en": "what we have to do is move pressable into our view here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.52,
          "end": 77.6,
          "en": "like this so that it only surrounds the text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.6,
          "end": 79.803,
          "en": "instead of the view box as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.42,
          "end": 83.95,
          "en": "If we do that and we reload all apps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.95,
          "end": 86.84,
          "en": "to make sure these changes get applied.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.84,
          "end": 89.883,
          "en": "Now, if we do this again on Android here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.46000000000001,
          "end": 95.12299999999999,
          "en": "you will see there is a slight ripple effect on the item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.31,
          "end": 98.85,
          "en": "Now, that ripple effect is now only on the text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.85,
          "end": 100.77000000000001,
          "en": "Not on the overall container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.77000000000001,
          "end": 105.22,
          "en": "And to fix this, what we can do is move our padding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.22,
          "end": 109.18,
          "en": "from the goal item which is the view, which is the container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.18,
          "end": 112.87,
          "en": "to the text because then the padding is part of the text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.87,
          "end": 115.37,
          "en": "and the ripple effect will take this padding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.37,
          "end": 116.763,
          "en": "into account as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.13,
          "end": 121.04,
          "en": "So now with that, if we set this up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.24,
          "end": 124.29,
          "en": "we got this ripple effect here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.29,
          "end": 127.02,
          "en": "And of course, you can play around with the ripple color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.02,
          "end": 128.403,
          "en": "to get the look you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 129.51,
          "end": 134.353,
          "en": "You could, for example, also take this purple color here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.92,
          "end": 140.92000000000002,
          "en": "And maybe choose a very dark purple as a color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.37,
          "end": 144.56,
          "en": "and now we have this, which maybe looks a bit nicer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.56,
          "end": 146.763,
          "en": "So, this is pretty easy on Android.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.63,
          "end": 152.36,
          "en": "Now on iOS, this doesn't have any effect though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.36,
          "end": 155.41,
          "en": "Here, if I press this and keep it pressed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.41,
          "end": 157.75,
          "en": "so that we could see a potential effect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.75,
          "end": 159.803,
          "en": "we don't see any effect at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 160.66,
          "end": 163.36,
          "en": "Now for iOS to add some styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 163.36,
          "end": 166.47,
          "en": "we can add the style prop to pressable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 166.47,
          "end": 169.74,
          "en": "which generally works like all your style props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.74,
          "end": 172.32999999999998,
          "en": "It takes such a styling object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 172.32999999999998,
          "end": 177.32999999999998,
          "en": "but it also takes a function as an alternative.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 177.55,
          "end": 181.694,
          "en": "And this function will be called automatically by pressable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 181.694,
          "end": 185.98,
          "en": "whenever the press state changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.98,
          "end": 189.33,
          "en": "You will get a argument here, a parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 189.33,
          "end": 192.33,
          "en": "with information about the current press state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 192.33,
          "end": 195.82,
          "en": "and you can use object destructuring to get hold",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 195.82,
          "end": 200.65,
          "en": "of the pressed property that's part of this object you get.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 200.65,
          "end": 203.57999999999998,
          "en": "You could also name the overall parameter pressData",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 203.57999999999998,
          "end": 206.68,
          "en": "and access pressData.pressed in that function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 206.68,
          "end": 208.37,
          "en": "It's up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 208.37,
          "end": 210.5,
          "en": "Here, I will use object destructuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 210.5,
          "end": 213.86,
          "en": "to directly get that pressed property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 213.86,
          "end": 216.852,
          "en": "So, that's provided by pressable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 216.852,
          "end": 219.53,
          "en": "And now we can return different style objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 219.53,
          "end": 222.46,
          "en": "based on the pressed state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 222.46,
          "end": 225.52,
          "en": "We can define them down here of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 225.52,
          "end": 228.38,
          "en": "We could have our pressed item here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 228.38,
          "end": 230.18,
          "en": "And there, we could say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 230.18,
          "end": 233.82999999999998,
          "en": "that we wanna set the opacity to 0.5, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 233.82999999999998,
          "end": 236,
          "en": "to make it slightly transparent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 236,
          "end": 239.86,
          "en": "With that up here, we can check pressed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 239.86,
          "end": 243.673,
          "en": "and if it's true, we return styles.pressedItem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 244.98,
          "end": 247.513,
          "en": "Otherwise, we return no special styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 248.61,
          "end": 249.92,
          "en": "If we save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 251.07,
          "end": 255.03,
          "en": "and I now do learn react native again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 255.03,
          "end": 257.76,
          "en": "you'll notice that if I press this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 257.76,
          "end": 261.67,
          "en": "we also get some feedback here on iOS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 261.67,
          "end": 265.76,
          "en": "Now of course, you could go for all kinds of feedback.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 265.76,
          "end": 267.7,
          "en": "You could also bring this view back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 267.7,
          "end": 270.56,
          "en": "into the pressable component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 270.56,
          "end": 272.65,
          "en": "and add another surrounding view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 272.65,
          "end": 275.78,
          "en": "so that you can influence the style in greater detail,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 275.78,
          "end": 278.72,
          "en": "and you can, for example, also change the background color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 278.72,
          "end": 280.21,
          "en": "Whatever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 280.21,
          "end": 282.75,
          "en": "Here, I'll keep this simple feedback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 282.75,
          "end": 286.33,
          "en": "but now we also do have some feedback with help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 286.33,
          "end": 290.723,
          "en": "of this function form of this style property here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
